        "original_id": "cba9f62b-9954-569e-8b37-970ec2063840",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alla Pugacheva, Igor Krutoy, Raimonds Pauls, Sandhy Sondoro\n- Events: New Wave international music contest\n- Places: Jūrmala, Latvia\n- Topics: popular music, young performers\n\nFacts:\n- Alla Pugacheva was born on 15 April 1949 and is a Soviet and Russian musical performer.\n- Alla Pugacheva's career started in 1965 and has continued since then.\n- New Wave is an international contest for young performers of popular music that was founded in 2002 by Igor Krutoy and Raimonds Pauls.\n- Alla Pugacheva later enhanced the New Wave contest.\n- Sandhy Sondoro won the 2009 International Contest of Young Pop Singer \"New Wave\" in Jūrmala, Latvia.",
